WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.602
-Coming this spring,
Broadway is back

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:06.672
with a new musical that captures
the spirit of our times.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.508
-Susan?

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.844
Oh, right.

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:14.748
She's in Colorado till Monday.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.085
♪ Chicken, chicken, chicken ♪

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.153
♪ Chicken, chicken, chicken ♪

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:23.255
♪ Eatin' all the chicken
in my house ♪

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:25.224
-It's "By Yourself:
The Musical,"

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:26.526 line:0%
a tribute to the little songs

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.028 line:0%
we all sing when
we're by ourselves.

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:31.931
-♪ Plates, oh, my God, girl ♪

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.199
♪ What did you do last night? ♪

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.034
♪ You covered in mess ♪

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:38.004
-♪ Oh, no, another Amazon box ♪

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.371
♪ What's in this box? ♪

00:00:39.371 --> 00:00:42.541
♪ What did I buy? ♪

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:44.643
Ha!
♪ Some envelopes ♪

00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:47.013
-That's right, the little songs
that make you think,

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:48.081
"Am I okay?"

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:49.315
-♪ Look at my hand ♪

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:50.850
♪ It's walkin' like a person ♪

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.953
♪ Walkin' like a person
on the other hand ♪

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.354
♪ Now it's kickin' ♪

00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:56.856
♪ Kickin' like it's dancin' ♪

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:59.725
♪ I think it's for the best that
I live alone ♪

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:02.895
-Audiences agree, "Finally,
a musical we can relate to."

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:05.965
Broadway.com says, "Not sure why
that cost money to see,

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.901
but I loved it," and
"The New York Times" raves --

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:11.771
♪ Typin', typin', typin',
tappin', tappin', tappin' ♪

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:14.540
♪ At the keys,
I'm the New York Times ♪

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:18.344
And, of course, no musical is
complete without drama.

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:20.413
-♪ Hello ♪

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:23.015
♪ It's bread ♪

00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:29.221
♪ I forgot that you were there
and now you have to go be dead ♪

00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:34.360
♪ See you on the other side ♪

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:36.562
-It's got surprises.

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:39.465
-♪ Everybody's on the Zoom
talkin' out of their ass ♪

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:42.435
-Sorry, could you mute yourself?
-Yes. I apologize.

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.337
-And don't worry, it's got hits.

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:46.439
-♪ When you touch me like this ♪

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:52.178
♪ And you touch me like this
and like that ♪

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.746
♪ I'm insane ♪

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:56.449
-But mostly it's 10-second
ditties that do not rhyme

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:58.317
about whatever a person
is looking at.

00:01:58.317 --> 00:02:00.886
-♪ Yogurt, what the hell
are you? ♪

00:02:00.886 --> 00:02:03.055
♪ My best guess is ♪

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:04.356
♪ Jiggly milk ♪

00:02:04.356 --> 00:02:05.925
-It's "By Yourself:
The Musical,"

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.293
a truly modern musical that
teaches us

00:02:08.293 --> 00:02:10.129
we might not be so alone
after all.

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:13.700
-♪ We are in love ♪
-♪ This bread's not so bad ♪

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.301
-♪ We're gettin' married ♪

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.036
-♪ You're like wet stuff with
Jello ♪

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:18.738
-♪ Too bad no one can hear me ♪

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:21.507
-♪ 'Cause damn, I can sing ♪

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:24.476
-♪ And you're the best at ♪

00:02:24.476 --> 00:02:26.546
♪ Doing the thing ♪

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:28.114
-"By Yourself: The Musical."

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:31.217 line:0%
Come on, you know you do it.

